      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Ladies and gentlemen, we are trapped within networks of globalism drawn from the tired, erroneous beliefs of our predecessors. Let it be known, the alliances that have shackled our country have fostered delusions of security at the expense of our prosperity. Consider the Prop 1B from California or Prop 117 from New York—laws passed forcefully abroad to strip down our borders and assets under the pretense of international peace.\n\nWe have been forced to allocate funding towards the protection of regions abroad where our own infrastructure crumbles to ruins. We cannot afford to stand sentinel for a world that feeds on our weaknesses. Dollar Diplomacy has prolonged itself to a lifeline draining our stores while others feast upon threats poised against us.\n\nAnd let's not forget the inflationary strain imposed by policies, agreements and mandates that siphon our economic vitality for foreign agendas. Their loss is our gain, yet their signs call for subservience. Let us pursue Reason—diminish the monopolies of these biased treaties and reclaim the money that has flowed away from your families' coffers!\n\nWe must dismantle these shackles. Do not surrender to the gravitational pull of appeasement. Rebuild a nation from within, brightening living standards concealed by our",
